-- IELTS Foundation: more lessons per skill. Reading goes from 1 to 6 lessons, Listening from 2 to 6 and Writing from 3 to 6,
-- in new chặng that build on the first ones. Every new point has a lesson, a practice set of three questions, and every
-- new chặng has a final test. Listening reuses recorded audio with new questions that follow its transcript.

-- New chặng.

-- New points and their prerequisites.

-- Reading.
1. No running near the pool.
2. Children under eight must have an adult with them.
3. Please shower before you swim.
4. Lockers: bring a one-pound coin. You get it back.
5. The pool closes 15 minutes before the end of the day.', 'VALID');
